    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d673">

                <pb facs="0789" n="669" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg669"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador McCormick
                        to Acting Secretary of State Adee.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-07-12"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 12, 1905</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 22.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: On the 10th instant I telegraphed the
                    Department that the difficulty with Germany regarding the French interests and
                    sphere of influence in Morocco had been settled, and I now send a copy and
                    translation of the official text of the arrangement signed by Germany and by
                    France on the 8th instant.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert S.
                    McCormick.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d673-a1.xml" xpointer="d673-a1"/>
